    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHelvic, Farranlea Park is a well presented five-bedroom semi-detached home on a site located just off the Model Farm Road, one of Cork city's most sought-after residential areas.\n\nPresented in very good decorative condition throughout, this spacious family home is ready for immediate occupation, offering generous living accommodation in a highly convenient and sought-after location.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises a porch, entrance hall, living room, family room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, bathroom, and playroom on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are five well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large private gated driveway bordered by mature hedging, providing excellent privacy and ample parking for multiple vehicles. The impressive rear garden features a paved patio area, a well-maintained lawn, and a Barna shed, offering an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, and family enjoyment.\n\nThis is a highly sought-after location close to MTU ,CUH, UCC, Bons Secours Hospital, Wilton shopping centre and is extremely convenient to Cork City Centre. The property is near to some of Cork's most sought-after schools on its doorstep and benefits from a number of bus service links to the city centre as well as being within short walking distance to the proposed Cork Luas route.\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a truly unique home or investment that should not be missed. \n\nDon't delay, arrange a viewing today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 2.13m x 2.18m\nBright and inviting porch featuring tiled flooring, providing a warm welcome to the home.\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.80m x 2.08m\nWelcoming entrance hall features an original terrazzo floor. The hall providing access to all ground-floor accommodation and benefiting from convenient understairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 4.64m x 3.94m\nWell-proportioned living room to the front of the home, benefiting from a bay window, ceiling cornicing & centre rose, and an open fireplace with a timber mantle with marble insert and gas fire fitting.\n\nFamily Room - 3.92m x 3.57m\nSpacious reception room benefiting from carpet flooring, fitted storage units and shelving, a feature tiled open fireplace, and a contemporary vertical radiator. There are French doors opening onto the rear garden.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 5.16m x 2.84m / 2.45m x 5.72m\nBright and spacious kitchen/dining room with tiled flooring throughout, fitted with a range of floor and eye-level units, an integrated oven and microwave, gas hob, and generous countertop space. The dining area features extensive fitted storage, a solid fuel stove with a stone surround, and a sliding patio door opening directly onto the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.96m x 2.85m\nConvenient utility room featuring tiled flooring and fitted with a range of floor and eye-level units. Plumbed for a washing machine and dryer, with direct access to the rear garden.\n\nBathroom - 1.93m x 2.80m\nFully tiled bathroom featuring a three-piece suite and an electric shower fitting.\n\nPlay Room - 4.62m x 4.13m\nWell-proportioned reception room to the front of the home, features carpet flooring and a large bay window.\n\nLanding - 2.89m x 2.39\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.93m x 3.58m\nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, benefiting from fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.92m x 3.66m\nGenerously sized double bedroom to the front of the home with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.30m x 4.13m\nLarge double bedroom to the front of the home, featuring a built-in bunk bed arrangement with integrated storage and timber steps providing access to the upper bunk. The room also benefits from a private en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.23m x 2.89m\nWell-appointed, fully tiled en-suite complete with a three-piece suite, power shower, and practical built-in shelving.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.55m x 4.16m\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the home with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 5 / Office - 2.79m x 2.36m\nVersatile single bedroom to the front of the home, currently utilised as a home office, and benefiting from fitted storage units.\n\nBathroom - 2.12m x 2.36m\nFully tiled family bathroom comprising a four-piece suite, including a bathtub and separate shower with an electric shower fitting.\n\n"
      },
